# Which tests a pull request runs (SPEC 23, "Test selection"). Read by scripts/select-tests.py,
# which ci.yml and fuzz.yml run in their `changes` jobs.
#
# Each line: a path glob, then the suites a change to a matching path needs. `*` matches within
# one folder, `**` across folders. A path takes the suites of EVERY line it matches. A path that
# no line matches runs everything, so a new file or folder is tested in full until it is mapped.
#
# Suites:
#   all            everything: every crate's tests, every integration test, the fuzz build
#   none           no test of its own; marks the path as mapped (documentation, packaging,
#                  supply chain: their own jobs check them)
#   fuzz           fuzz.yml (2 minutes per target)
#   unit:<crate>   that crate's tests (also implied for the crate a changed file belongs to,
#                  and for every workspace crate that depends on it: `cargo metadata`)
#   <target>       an integration test of crates/sealctl/tests/ (`cargo test --test <target>`);
#                  its test-hooks steps in ci.yml run with it
#
# Only the macOS job and the test-hooks steps are selected: `test (ubuntu-latest)` runs the
# whole `cargo test` on every pull request. Push to main, schedules, manual runs, tags and
# pull requests labelled `ci:full` run everything.

# ---- everything ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# build inputs, toolchain, CI and this selection itself
Cargo.lock                                  all
**/Cargo.toml                               all
rust-toolchain.toml                         all
flake.*                                     all
.github/workflows/**                        all
.github/test-map                            all
scripts/select-tests*                       all
# the shared core: every crate and test builds on it
crates/sealctl-core/**                      all
# test helpers: the fake relay and scripted phone, the integration tests' shared code and fixtures
crates/sealctl-fakerelay/**                 all
crates/sealctl/tests/common/**              all
crates/sealctl/tests/fixtures/**            all

