crates/sealctl/src/daemon/client.rs         daemon session secrets volumes long_ops unseal migrate pairing leak
crates/sealctl/src/daemon/channel.rs        daemon session secrets volumes long_ops unseal migrate pairing leak
crates/sealctl/src/daemon/session.rs        daemon session secrets
